            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Yeroboamu owokubiri bye yakola, omuli n'eby'amaani bye yakola, n'entalo dhe yalwana, era n'ensambo ye yaizaamu ku Isiraeli ebibuga Damasiko ni Hamathi ebyali mu Buyudaaya, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo ky'Ebyomubyanda bya Bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yeroboamu Owokubiri yaafa, yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli. Mutabane we Zekaria yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.29",
